<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intermedia Comm upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intermedia Comm upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised the rating on Intermedia Communications Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/8 to 24-1/4.</p>
</text>
